  "body": "## What's new\n- **Listening statistics:** total, today, last 7 days, this month, most listened station, top 5, sessions, 14-day chart and history. Only time when audio really plays is counted; data stays on your phone and can be deleted.\n- **Share a station** with any app, or show a **QR code** (points to the official DOMINIX download page) — share it or save it to the gallery.\n- **Report a problem** with a station (reason + optional description) via GitHub, any app, or copy the text.\n- **Check station:** test whether a station's stream answers, without stopping what is playing.\n- Station actions: tap ⋮ in the player or long-press a station.\n\n## Download\n- **Dominix-v1.3.0.apk** — install directly (Android 7.0+)\n- **Dominix-v1.3.0.zip** — same APK in a ZIP, for browsers that hang on APK downloads (e.g. Brave on Xiaomi)\n\nInstalls over earlier versions — favorites and settings are kept. Users of v1.2.0 will also be told about this update inside the app.\n\n**Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO:** Settings → Apps → Dominix → Battery saver → *No restrictions*, and enable *Autostart*.\n\n© 2026 Dominantus. All rights reserved.\n\nSHA-256 (APK): `49c5eba433def7160f71a80925601a5d6eccc0cbe5a6d140a157a9416232a002`\n"
